| C | G7 | G7 | C | C | G7 | G7 | C |
| G7 | C | F | G7 | C | G7 | G7 | C | C / G7 | C |

melody:
# 9/8: each bar is 9 eighth-note beats
Beau-ti-ful dream-er, wake un-to me,
C5 B4 C5 G4(3) E4(3) D4 C#4 D4 A4(3) ~A4(3)
star-light and dew-drops are wait-ing for thee;
G4 B4 A4 A4 G4 F4 F4 E4 D4 E4(3) ~E4(3) ~E4(3)
sounds of the rude world heard in the day,
C5 B4 C5 G4(3) E4(3) D4 C#4 D4 A4(3) ~A4(3)
lulled by the moon-light have all passed a-way!
G4 B4 A4 A4 G4 F4 F4 E4 D4 C4(3) ~C4(3) ~C4(3)
Beau-ti-ful dream-er, queen of my song,
G4 F4 D4 B3(3) A4(3) A4 G4 E4 C4(3) ~C4(3)
list while I woo thee with soft mel-o-dy;
C5 B4 C5 A4(3) E5(2) C5 B4 C5 A4 G4(3) ~G4(3)
gone are the cares of life's bu-sy throng,
C5 C5 C5 B4(3) G4(3) D4 C#4 D4 A4(3) ~A4(3)
Beau-ti-ful dream-er, a-wake un-to me!
G4 B4 A4 A4 G4 F4 F4 E4 D4 E4(3) ~E4(3) ~E4(3)
Beau-ti-ful dream-er, a-wake un-to me!
A4 B4 C5 C5 G4 E4 F4 E4 D4 C4(3) ~C4(3) ~C4(3)
